  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The fish finger sandwich is thick-cut white fish coated in "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "panko",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "panko"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " breadcrumbs, fried until golden, and packed into white bread with tartare sauce. The panko crust stays crisp under the sauce longer than fine breadcrumbs. It takes 25 minutes from start to finish and is one of the better quick lunches in British cooking."
          }
        ]
      },
